data: {"id": "856f12487ef345fc-final", "run_id": "856f12487ef345fc", "seq": 1230, "ts_ms": 1789041357026, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | DNS解析失败导致无法拉取镜像：Kubelet在尝试从无效仓库域名 registry.invalid 拉取镜像时，因DNS服务器（127.0.0.53）无法解析该主机名，导致连接失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | K8s `event.message` | `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": ... failed to resolve reference ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 直接证实 DNS 解析失败，明确指向无效域名 `registry.invalid` 和 DNS 服务器 `127.0.0.53` 报错。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | K8s `event.message` | `Error: ImagePullBackOff` / `Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 证实拉取失败后的重试与退避机制，确认故障持续存在。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | K8s `pod.status` | `Pending` | 证实 Pod 因镜像无法拉取而卡止在 Pending 状态。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` | 1 (labels: `reason=ImagePullBackOff`) | 观测确认容器处于等待原因 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态。 |\n\n**证据印证说明**：K8s Event 中的 `no such host` 具体报错证实了 `registry.invalid` 域名的不可达性；Metrics 观测到的 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态与 K8s Event 中的重试记录完全吻合；状态为 `Pending` 证实了故障直接导致 Pod 无法正常启动，而非运行崩溃。Logging 和 Tracing 因容器未启动而物理上缺失，符合预期。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n镜像仓库域名无效或DNS配置缺失 (registry.invalid) → DNS解析失败 (no such host) → 镜像拉取失败 (ImagePullBackOff) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**镜像仓库域名配置无效导致 DNS 解析失败**。\n\n1.  **机制确认**：Kubelet 尝试拉取镜像 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 时，DNS 服务器 (`127.0.0.53`) 无法解析该主机名（`fact-8d9cf6136e16`），导致连接建立失败。\n2.  **状态确认**：拉取失败触发了容器的 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态，致使 Pod 一直停留在 `Pending` 状态（`fact-57e2afa89369`、`fact-2514836ff2be`）。\n3.  **结论**：集群问题的根本原因在于容器配置中引用的镜像仓库地址 `registry.invalid` 在集群网络中无法通过 DNS 解析，导致镜像拉取流程中断。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 76.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp: 76.4s (Evidence 70.2s, RCA 6.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 108.198, "metrics": {"run_id": "856f12487ef345fc", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 108.2038905620575, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 108203.8905620575, "llm_calls": 9, "llm_duration_ms": 105089.08224105835, "tool_calls": 6, "executed_tool_calls": 6, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 6, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7547.779321670532, "tool_wa